{"w":2400,"h":3209,"lines":[{"t":"Sample Writing answers","y":0.042056074937395604,"h":0.017536948254546658,"x":0.08349514483209762,"w":0.23106796264648433,"c":1},{"h":0.025773609910055839,"w":0.35597938537597656,"t":"TEST 3, WRITING TASK 1","c":1,"y":0.088890905888150296,"x":0.083221559859558925},{"w":0.80582524617513007,"h":0.017518836761189371,"c":1,"y":0.12928348891691011,"x":0.083495144215563352,"t":"This model has been prepared by an examiner as an example of a very good answer."},{"x":0.081470980442055155,"w":0.71665496826171882,"c":1,"y":0.1572608928164575,"t":"The diagrams show Central Library before and after changes were made to its layout.","h":0.023228398736020894},{"w":0.81960250854492189,"c":1,"t":"Clearly, the library has been updated to include dedicated spaces for events and now has an open","h":0.023806710406627185,"x":0.083402497763643169,"y":0.18574985925526111},{"y":0.20992093948046242,"w":0.16782646179199218,"h":0.021563932234624494,"c":1,"t":"space in the centre.","x":0.082966873501432684},{"t":"Twenty years ago, to the left of the entrance there was a reading room with newspapers and","h":0.020348838259497848,"c":1,"w":0.76116505940755208,"x":0.083495140148386326,"y":0.23982558086639716},{"w":0.80427449544270835,"t":"magazines and to the right there was an enquiry desk. Now there's a computer room on the left","h":0.026902675925756903,"y":0.25679935206712745,"c":1,"x":0.083317510263857461},{"h":0.020394117884175333,"c":1,"w":0.80388351440429684,"x":0.083495136197851524,"t":"and a café where the information desk once was. Adult fiction has moved to the right-hand side","y":0.28193146402609681},{"x":0.083413694982325814,"y":0.30308700011036394,"c":1,"t":"of the room and all reference books are now on the left. There is a smaller information desk with","w":0.81375157674153664,"h":0.019669160218996451},{"y":0.3255451714393629,"x":0.083495147114131266,"w":0.580582529703776,"t":"self-service machines in what once was the adult non-fiction section.","h":0.017478083672924583,"c":1},{"t":"There was a room at the back left-hand corner that had computer games, CDs and videos that has","c":1,"w":0.82928685506184907,"x":0.083418857654424125,"y":0.35421043068538194,"h":0.022701635390427244},{"y":0.37606025676246446,"h":0.022520401618933761,"c":1,"x":0.0834375595132201,"w":0.80981791178385421,"t":"since been enlarged and houses children's fiction. It has a space with two sofas where storytelling"},{"h":0.026993831741475738,"t":"events are held. There is a lecture room in the back right-hand corner where children's books","x":0.083340282693971993,"y":0.39485001095897299,"w":0.79255864461263037,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.42016211455980335,"t":"used to be.","x":0.083186493327240568,"w":0.099813849131266286,"h":0.018987551656467483},{"t":"Here are comments from another examiner:","y":0.45919003117651924,"h":0.014647178412226514,"c":1,"x":0.08543689754305489,"w":0.41359222412109375},{"c":1,"y":0.49368710367646829,"h":0.020715538809232603,"t":"This response covers the main changes that have occurred over the 20-year period.","x":0.13194736852673353,"w":0.78655705769856776},{"x":0.13197543794718589,"y":0.51279843862508456,"h":0.020228804828964608,"c":1,"w":0.78458338419596352,"t":"An overview is presented in the second paragraph which is quite general: it refers to"},{"x":0.13004104593969582,"w":0.78847880045572916,"c":1,"t":"the [dedicated spaces for events] but this could be improved by giving a summary of","h":0.019429329845392806,"y":0.53154952350522888},{"c":1,"x":0.12999062374698761,"t":"the key changes (dedicated spaces for events, self-service facilities and a café).","y":0.54947522798019222,"w":0.75165044148763016,"h":0.02242060153283798},{"w":0.75751983642578125,"c":1,"h":0.020734961679048647,"x":0.13000327758804511,"y":0.58710811229135029,"t":"Ideas are arranged logically: the changes to the front of the library are presented"},{"h":0.020443668543735471,"y":0.60601754584234202,"w":0.7651845296223958,"c":1,"t":"in the third paragraph and the changes to the back section in the final paragraph.","x":0.13002349178497583},{"y":0.62440268448617586,"c":1,"w":0.7477990214029947,"h":0.021302659934926305,"x":0.13387245701476302,"t":"This shows a logical approach to reporting the changes and there is some good"},{"x":0.13203883363021163,"c":1,"t":"cohesion [once was | now on the left | has since been].","y":0.64534883709502844,"w":0.51844660441080725,"h":0.017579511838538675},{"y":0.68161993745489236,"x":0.13398058326717149,"t":"There is a good range of vocabulary. In this kind of task, vocabulary from the floor","w":0.76893203735351556,"h":0.017507969627499231,"c":1},{"y":0.69802676830241561,"c":1,"w":0.76924051920572922,"t":"plan needs to be used to report the changes, but the use of different words shows","h":0.023925208451220592,"x":0.13381834331956108},{"t":"some flexibility and precision [been updated | dedicated spaces | houses].","c":1,"x":0.13387059545823946,"w":0.69532323201497404,"h":0.021650617367753422,"y":0.71681374575898194},{"y":0.75519783412074215,"c":1,"w":0.6953035990397135,"x":0.13196898999951864,"h":0.021647993426456624,"t":"In terms of grammar, there are error-free sentences and some variation in"},{"t":"structures used when describing changes [has been updated | what once was | has","h":0.017502535763559313,"c":1,"y":0.77470930220968415,"w":0.78446604410807286,"x":0.13398057021113724},{"h":0.01748442367601255,"t":"since been enlarged].","c":1,"x":0.13398058069984359,"y":0.79501557642554377,"w":0.20582524617513021},{"c":1,"t":"The response could be improved by extending the overview to include more of","w":0.73812820434570314,"x":0.13386589988091363,"y":0.82843726690905051,"h":0.021239021039826111},{"c":1,"x":0.13389963847752265,"t":"a summary of the main changes but overall, this response captures the main","h":0.020487700370241946,"y":0.84859083547564007,"w":0.72054819742838538},{"w":0.23883494059244792,"h":0.015988371899566145,"t":"changes in a logical way.","x":0.13398058783861966,"y":0.8706395349715671,"c":1},{"w":0.034951454798380535,"h":0.014534883112922281,"t":"132","c":1,"x":0.089320389008576723,"y":0.95930232583997788}]}